<title>MALAYSIA: KL palm oil seen opening down as soyoil falls.</title>
<headline>KL palm oil seen opening down as soyoil falls.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian palm oil prices were expected to open two to three ringgit down as a lower soyoil futures overnight and lack of fresh developments may spark off some selling, traders said.</p>
<p>Trading was expected to remain cautious amid uncertainty over the immediate trend, they said.</p>
<p>* Sept resistance pegged at 1,180 ringgit</p>
<p>* Sept support - 1,150 ringgit</p>
<p>* Sept closed on Monday at 1,161 ringgit</p>
</text>
